@startuml components
' Layered ports-and-adapters component view (Claude proposal). See architecture.md sections 4-5.
title SplitSmart - Components and Dependency Direction (proposal)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "splitsmart-swing (presentation)" {
  [Views (JPanel)] as Views
  [Presenters] as Presenters
  [Remote API client\n(implements application.api)] as ApiClient
}

package "splitsmart-server (only if ADR-002 option B)" {
  [Remote API adapter\n(resolves Principal from session)] as ApiAdapter
}

package "splitsmart-application" {
  interface "application.api\nFacades + DTO records" as Facades
  [AccountService] as AccountSvc
  [GroupService] as GroupSvc
  [ExpenseService] as ExpenseSvc
  [ReviewService] as ReviewSvc
  [PaymentService] as PaymentSvc
  [BalanceQueryService] as BalanceSvc
  [NotificationService] as NotifSvc
  [ReportService] as ReportSvc
  [AccessPolicy] as Access
  interface "port: Repositories,\nUnitOfWork" as Repos
  interface "port: EmailGateway" as EmailPort
  interface "port: ReceiptStore" as ReceiptPort
  interface "port: PasswordHasher,\nTotpVerifier, SecretCipher" as CryptoPort
  interface "port: Clock, IdGenerator,\nSupportedCurrencies" as InfraPort
}

package "splitsmart-domain" {
  [Aggregates: UserAccount, Group,\nExpense, Payment] as Aggs
  [Value objects: Money, CurrencyUnit,\nPercentage, DateRange] as VOs
  [ShareAllocator] as Allocator
  [ApprovalPolicy\nSingleReviewerPolicy (MVP)\nMultiLevelPolicy (FULL)] as Approval
  [BalanceCalculator] as BalCalc
}

package "splitsmart-infrastructure" {
  [Persistence adapter (OQ-06)\n+ in-memory adapter] as PersistAd
  [Email adapter (OQ-07)\n+ OutboxDispatcher] as EmailAd
  [Receipt adapter (OQ-08)] as ReceiptAd
  [JDK crypto adapters\nPBKDF2 / TOTP / AES-GCM] as CryptoAd
  [System clock, UUID generator,\ncurrency config] as SysAd
  [Composition roots\n(manual wiring)] as Roots
}

Views --> Presenters
Presenters --> Facades : uses
ApiClient ..> Facades : implements (client side)
ApiAdapter --> Facades : delegates

AccountSvc ..> Facades : implements
GroupSvc ..> Facades : implements
ExpenseSvc ..> Facades : implements
ReviewSvc ..> Facades : implements
PaymentSvc ..> Facades : implements
BalanceSvc ..> Facades : implements
NotifSvc ..> Facades : implements
ReportSvc ..> Facades : implements

AccountSvc --> Access
GroupSvc --> Access
ExpenseSvc --> Access
ReviewSvc --> Access
PaymentSvc --> Access
BalanceSvc --> Access
NotifSvc --> Access
ReportSvc --> Access

ExpenseSvc --> Allocator
ExpenseSvc --> Aggs
ReviewSvc --> Approval
PaymentSvc --> Aggs
BalanceSvc --> BalCalc
Aggs --> VOs
Allocator --> VOs

ExpenseSvc --> Repos
ExpenseSvc --> ReceiptPort
NotifSvc --> EmailPort
AccountSvc --> CryptoPort
AccountSvc --> InfraPort

PersistAd ..> Repos : implements
EmailAd ..> EmailPort : implements
ReceiptAd ..> ReceiptPort : implements
CryptoAd ..> CryptoPort : implements
SysAd ..> InfraPort : implements
Roots --> PersistAd
Roots --> EmailAd
Roots --> ReceiptAd
Roots --> CryptoAd
Roots --> SysAd

note right of Allocator
  Domain depends on nothing:
  no Swing, I/O, or clock access.
end note
note bottom of Views
  Swing depends only on application.api.
  Enforced by Maven modules + JPMS exports.
end note
@enduml
